  "details": "Avatar invites/requests would work just like a regular invite/request, but it would let the person receiving it equip the avatar the other person is currently using.\nThis would be super useful for sharing avatars if you have cloning OFF (and don't want it ON), for commissions, etc.\nThis is the minimum implementation, but it could go further.\nFor example: if this worked with private avatars it could add the recipients to a whitelist to use it. Or you could access an invite menu from the avatar description to be able to do it with an avatar that is not the currently selected one (or the opposite, have an avatar selector from the invite).",
